<footer class="colophon">
  <div class="colophon__mark">~ finis ~</div>
  <p class="colophon__text">
    Cyanotypes from the New York Public Library, Spencer Collection (Sir John Herschel’s set,
    digitised 2014–2015). Modern photographs are drawn from <em>iNaturalist</em> — the work
    of many naturalists, each credited per image. The cyanotypes are in the public domain.
  </p>
  <div class="colophon__meta">
    <a href="https://digitalcollections.nypl.org/collections/photographs-of-british-algae-cyanotype-impressions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">N.Y.P.L. source</a>
    <span>·</span>
    <a href="https://www.inaturalist.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">iNaturalist</a>
